b4ccae84e468"],

Cell["\<\
Here I visualise the fields and analysis different quantities of interest.
Obj is the variable that contains all your data.
The entries are: {time, field, y index, x index, u index}
Below I visualise the keys, they show the fields Obj contains. c=n \
corresponds to the n subdomain of u.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9720382077049913`*^9, 3.972038272883155*^9}, {
  3.972038303997719*^9, 3.972038347321348*^9}, {3.9720384449909554`*^9, 
  3.972038481842904*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9f693c04-93ea-4218-8168-\
798cd068495c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

